			"Message": "docs(Land): Document ProductFlavor encoding and normalize doc formatting\n\nAdd the ProductFlavor 10-char encoding scheme to EnvironmentVariables.md and the TierGatedImplementationSelection workflow doc, covering the 5x2-char routing code groups (IPC+WS, Tasks+Auth, Terminal+SCM+Debug, Search+Language+Output, Storage+Model+FileSystem) and all four flavor variants (Default/RustOnly/Node/Full+MistWS). Also update the ProductEmbedderIdentifier default from land-desktop to fiddee-desktop.\n\nNormalize list separator punctuation across BuildPipeline.md, Building.md, EditorCore.md, and InterComponentProtocol.md, replacing em dashes with spaced hyphens for consistent rendering. Reflow overlong paragraph lines at the established 100-char width in EditorCore.md, InterComponentProtocol.md, and VSCode-API-Coverage-Matrix.md. Adjust table column widths in InterComponentProtocol.md for uniform Markdown rendering.",
			"SHA": "ea90e33dea6729a69dd069711b8141f7aca31a81"
		},
